[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0010","text":"怎么了，小豆丸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0020","text":"嗯？────啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0030","text":"雨停了——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0040","text":"……哦，果穗\n在遛小豆丸吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0050","text":"树里酱！凛世小姐！\n你们好——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0060","text":"哦，你好／你好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0070","text":"我刚才在散步，\n小豆丸告诉我『雨停了』……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0080","text":"然后，你们看！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0090","text":"晴空……\n还有彩虹……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900300_03_0100","text":"是的！\n看到了好美的景象！"}]
